@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
top to bottom direction
title Deployment-01 — cấu hình mục tiêu AWS Ubuntu (chưa xác minh live)
node "Laptop / điện thoại" as CLIENT {
  artifact "Trình duyệt" as BROWSER
}
cloud "Internet / DNS A" as DNS
node "AWS EC2 Ubuntu 24.04\nx86_64 · 52.64.177.7" as VPS {
  node "Docker edge network" {
    node "proxy: Caddy" as PROXY
    node "web: Next.js :3000" as WEB
    node "api: NestJS :3001\nOrders / Payments / Refunds worker" as API
  }
  node "Docker internal database network" {
    database "db: PostgreSQL :5432" as DB
    artifact "pgdata volume" as DATA
    node "migrate: one-shot Prisma" as MIG
  }
  artifact ".env.production\nchmod 600" as ENV
  artifact "caddy_data: TLS\nJSON logs có rotation" as LOG
}
node "GitHub Actions / GHCR" as CI
cloud "VNPay Sandbox" as VN
BROWSER --> DNS : domain
DNS --> PROXY : HTTPS 443 / HTTP 80 redirect
PROXY --> WEB : routes UI
PROXY --> API : /api/* bỏ prefix
API --> DB : Prisma / TCP5432
DB -- DATA
MIG --> DB : migration trước app
API --> VN : outbound HTTPS QueryDR / refund
VN --> PROXY : HTTPS IPN
CI --> VPS : SSH22, image SHA, smoke HTTPS
ENV ..> API
ENV ..> MIG
PROXY -- LOG
note bottom of DB: Không publish DB/API port trên host.
note bottom of CI
Local: web3000, api3001, DB loopback5433.
CI: DB _test riêng, unit/integration/E2E, build images.
Production: secret server/CI; không có secret trong image.
end note
@enduml
